NOTE ON DATASET LICENSE

This project evaluates models on the GAOKAO-Bench dataset:

    GAOKAO-Bench — https://github.com/OpenLMLab/GAOKAO-Bench
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The dataset itself is NOT included in this repository. `scripts/01_download_official_data.py`
downloads it directly from the upstream repository at run time. Any question text,
answers, or analysis content that appears in the result files under `results/`
originates from GAOKAO-Bench and remains subject to its Apache-2.0 license.

Citation:

    @inproceedings{Zhang2023EvaluatingTP,
      title={Evaluating the Performance of Large Language Models on GAOKAO Benchmark},
      author={Xiaotian Zhang and Chunyang Li and Yi Zong and Zhengyu Ying and Liang He and Xipeng Qiu},
      year={2023}
    }
